[FIBA 3x3 RULES SUMMARY]
- Half-court 15m x 11m grid (x in 0..14, y in 0..10); basket is at (7, 1); 2-point arc radius is 6.75m.
- Game is 10:00 regulation or first team to 21 points. Tied at 00:00 goes to overtime (first to score +2 in OT wins).
- Shot clock is 12 seconds. Inside the arc = 1 point; beyond the arc = 2 points.
